{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AGUICore\/documentation\/AGUICore\/AGUIEventDecoder"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AGUICore\/documentation\/AGUICore"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AGUIEventDecoder"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AGUIEventDecoder"},{"type":"text","text":" decodes JSON event data into strongly-typed event objects based on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the “type” field in the JSON. It uses a registry-based architecture that allows you to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"customize which event types are supported and how unknown events are handled."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Basic Usage","anchor":"Basic-Usage"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Create a decoder with default settings (strict mode)","let decoder = AGUIEventDecoder()","","\/\/ Decode an event from JSON data","let event = try decoder.decode(jsonData)","","\/\/ Pattern match on the event type","switch event.eventType {","case .runStarted:","    let runStarted = event as! RunStartedEvent","    print(\"Run started: \\(runStarted.runId)\")","case .runFinished:","    let runFinished = event as! RunFinishedEvent","    print(\"Run finished: \\(runFinished.runId)\")","default:","    print(\"Other event: \\(event.eventType)\")","}"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Configuration Modes","anchor":"Configuration-Modes"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Strict Mode (Default)","anchor":"Strict-Mode-Default"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In strict mode, unknown or unsupported events throw errors:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let decoder = AGUIEventDecoder() \/\/ Default: .throwError","\/\/ Throws EventDecodingError.unknownEventType for unrecognized types"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Tolerant Mode","anchor":"Tolerant-Mode"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In tolerant mode, unknown events are returned as "},{"code":"UnknownEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var config = AGUIEventDecoder.Configuration()","config.unknownEventStrategy = .returnUnknown","let decoder = AGUIEventDecoder(config: config)","","let event = try decoder.decode(data)","if let unknown = event as? UnknownEvent {","    print(\"Unknown event type: \\(unknown.typeRaw)\")","    \/\/ Can still access raw JSON for forwarding or logging","}"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Custom Registries","anchor":"Custom-Registries"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can provide a custom registry to control which event types are supported:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let customRegistry: [EventType: AGUIEventDecoder.DecodeHandler] = [","    .runStarted: { data, decoder in","        try decoder.decode(RunStartedEventDTO.self, from: data).toDomain(rawEvent: data)","    }","    \/\/ Add more handlers as needed","]","","let decoder = AGUIEventDecoder(registry: customRegistry)"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Error Handling","anchor":"Error-Handling"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The decoder throws ","type":"text"},{"code":"EventDecodingError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for various failure scenarios:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".missingTypeField","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": The JSON is missing the required “type” field","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidJSON"},{"type":"text","text":": The JSON data is malformed or invalid"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknownEventType(String)"},{"text":": The event type is not recognized (strict mode only)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unsupportedEventType(EventType)"},{"type":"text","text":": The event type is known but has no handler (strict mode only)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".decodingFailed(String)"},{"type":"text","text":": Field-level decoding errors with detailed messages"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Thread Safety","anchor":"Thread-Safety"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"AGUIEventDecoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is thread-safe and can be used concurrently. The decoder itself","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is immutable after initialization, and all configuration is ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AGUIEvent"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventType"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventDecodingError"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnknownEvent"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"See Also"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Decoder for AG-UI protocol events with polymorphic deserialization.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","title":"AGUIEventDecoder","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AGUIEventDecoder","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"AGUICore"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8AGUICore16AGUIEventDecoderV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AGUIEventDecoder","kind":"identifier"}]},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","generated":true